WEBVTT

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:15.460
Anpanman

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:16.300
Daechi

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.840
Stop it!

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.240
Roll-Panna-chan!

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.520
Roll-Panna-chan!

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:25.840
What are you doing?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:30.660
Oh, my God.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:19.950
Ehhh, I'm not the only one who's a man of my life, I'm not the only one who's a man of my life!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:46.450
If only Melonpanna hadn't come out there, I would have been able to make Anpama Gittan Gittan.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.710
I like ice.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:53.270
I like ice.

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.160
That's right.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:59.320
A very beautiful star in the castle of ice where the queen lives.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:01:59.980
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:05.780
Don't say it so easily.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.420
I'm really bad at digging.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:12.570
You said it was a jewel for me.

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:19.400
I got it.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:21.240
Wait a minute.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.820
I thought of something good.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:27.420
Mister.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:31.950
I'm going to the sea.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.850
I'm counting on you, Anpanman and Melonpanna.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.320
Then I'm going to the sea.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.030
I'm going to the next town.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:40.830
I'm going.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.000
Have a nice trip.

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:36.530
The castle of ice should be near here.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:52.880
It's Baikinman.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.360
Step on my ice country.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.820
I won't forgive him for what he did to me.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:07.960
Wait, I brought a good story to the Queen of Ice.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.690
To take care of Anpanman.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.740
I can't believe you're talking about Baikinman.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.160
It's true.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.940
I saw this and grabbed the melon panna of Anpanman's friends.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:28.430
All right.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.690
To my castle.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.380
Thank you for watching.

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.400
I'd like to hear your story.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.850
I want this melon panna to be locked in an ice castle.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.650
Then I can defeat Anpanman with a roll panna.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.850
That's why you're trying to work with me.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:24.750
If Anpanman isn't around, the world will remain as it is.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:29.860
Then the ice castle will be in a big place and the world will be frozen.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.550
I can make the world an ice kingdom!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.340
An ice kingdom?

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:41.340
I can freeze the earth and build a bigger ice castle that is suitable for the ice queen.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.210
Isn't that a good idea?

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.230
I see.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:47.690
Hehehe.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:49.250
Hehehe.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:09.880
I can't get out of this castle of ice!

00:06:19.324 --> 00:06:19.824
Nani?

00:06:20.156 --> 00:06:22.156
Thank you for watching!

00:06:23.228 --> 00:06:24.228
I have to do this

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.340
Melonpanna-chan wasn't here, was she?

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:52.770
Melonpanna?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.300
Melonpanna-chan didn't come back.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.700
I hope there's nothing in Melonpanna-chan's body.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:00.500
I'm good...

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:13.980
You can't listen to what you're talking about!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:21.330
I'll tell you what to do.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:22.680
I'm done with you all.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.300
Hey Kinman, the ice jewel is not there?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.200
How long are you going to keep us waiting?

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:34.650
Dogen-chan, that story will come later. Now is the chance to treat Anpanma!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:41.060
I've locked Melonpanna in an ice castle.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:47.680
If I do that, Rollpanna won't get in the way and I can treat Anpanma until the end.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.740
I see.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:50.870
What?

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:52.960
I'm sorry.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.070
Baikinman, what are you doing?

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:57.440
What?

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:11.150
Oh, my God, I'm going to do it.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:24.680
It's true that I locked it up.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:31.650
Where is the ice castle?

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:37.380
It's far away in the cold, cold ice country.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.000
Banner!

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:41.280
Banner!

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:50.540
I have to tell Uncle Banner!

00:09:03.868 --> 00:09:04.748
What did you say?

00:09:04.956 --> 00:09:06.136
That's terrible!

00:09:06.556 --> 00:09:07.356
I got it!

00:09:07.996 --> 00:09:11.236
I'm going to save Melonpanna with Anpanmango!

00:10:01.148 --> 00:10:01.408
What?

00:10:34.316 --> 00:10:34.816
Hmm?

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:36.020
Mm-hm-hm-hm.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.820
You

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:41.170
I'll give it to you.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:49.010
You are a brother, aren't you?

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:49.630
You are...

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.180
The owner of this castle.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.300
The Queen of Ice!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:59.090
I'm going to make you meet the cute snow wolves of this castle in a cruel way.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.740
It seems to have changed.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.740
It's a strange child.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:16.070
I can see your heart well.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.750
In that heart, like me,

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.710
A cold heart is hidden.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.030
No, my sister's heart is not cold.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:31.450
Shut up!

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:39.530
If you want to be a hero of the blood, you can help me.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:41.070
Yes!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:49.360
Is that your answer?

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:50.460
Huh?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.450
I wonder if it's true.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.100
I want you to be my collection.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:26.050
I want you to be my collection.

00:13:32.556 --> 00:13:33.416
I knew it.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.060
Anpanman!

00:13:40.044 --> 00:13:41.804
It's almost time for the Ice Castle!

00:13:59.212 --> 00:13:59.972
You did a good job.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:00.670
What are you doing?

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:22.250
The door is spinning.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:23.990
I'll get off.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:24.960
I can't move with my hands.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.020
Yuuki!

00:14:56.652 --> 00:14:57.152
Hurry up!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.180
I'm not Panjia

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:45.630
I have to save him!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.550
I won't let you get away, Anpanman!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.690
You'll be in my collection, too!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:10.790
What are you doing?

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.790
Takai!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:54.330
I'm going to get a jewel in the meantime.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.760
The snow wolf! Those two!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.360
I'll make a new face!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:35.650
I'm going to defeat you and change this world into an ice-cold world!

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.910
Prepare yourself, Anpanman!

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:46.780
I swear!

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:39.250
I'll let you eat it!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:58.320
I got the gem!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.440
Bye-bye, Kinnanoda!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:09.820
Let's go!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.760
to warm up Rollpanna-chan.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:10.580
That's great!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.610
The snowmen!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.080
Snowmen?

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:27.700
The snowmen will be born again when the next snow falls.

00:20:30.444 --> 00:20:32.304
I'm glad I was of use to you all.

00:20:38.924 --> 00:20:40.924
Let's sing together, snowman!

00:20:43.084 --> 00:20:43.584
Thank you

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:31.600
Thank you.
